    "not_listed": [],
    "why": "A take store rewrites its manifest when it closes, so a run repeated for one setting leaves a manifest naming that setting alone. The takes are still on disk and are read here; which of them the manifest had forgotten is named, because a record silently built from a shortened manifest reads exactly like a complete one."
  },
